#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kget; Drop Target has four options."
msgstr "&kget; Mjesto za spuštanje ima četiri opcije."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of &kget; drop target</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Snimak ekrana od &kget; mijesto za spuštanje</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of &kget; drop target</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Snimak ekrana od  &kget; mjesto za spuštanje</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kget; Drop Target options"
msgstr "&kget; opcije Mijesta za spuštanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Right click on the drop target to see the options."
msgstr "Kliknite desnim klikom da vidite opcije Mijesta za spuštanje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Start / Resume All</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenuitem>Start / Nastavi Sve</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start a download or resume all the pending downloads. The shortcut for "
"doing this is <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>"
msgstr ""
"Za pocetak preuzimanja ili nastavak svih preuzimanja na čekanju.Kratica za "
"ovo je  <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>R</keycap></keycombo>"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show/Hide Main Window"
msgstr "Prikaži/Sakrij Glavni Prozor"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option shows or minimizes the main window to the system tray."
msgstr "Ova opcija prikazuje ili smanjuje glavni prozor u sistemski ugao"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sticky"
msgstr "Ljepljiva"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes the &kget; drop target undraggable."
msgstr "Čini  &kget; mijesto za spuštanje fiksnim."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quit &kget;"
msgstr "Prekini &kget;"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:165 index.docbook:758
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quits &kget;"
msgstr "Završava &kget;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kget;'s Configuration window"
msgstr "&kget; Konfikuracijski prozor"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kget;</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Podešavanja</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Podesi &kget;</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the &kget; configuration window"
msgstr "Otvara &kget; Konfiguracijski prozor"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Appearance</title>"
msgstr "<title>Izgled</title>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Appearance</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Izgled</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Appearance</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Izgled</phrase>"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Appearance</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Izgled</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can modify the various appearance related stuff here."
msgstr "Ovdje mozete izmijeniti razne stvari vezane za izgled."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show splashscreen"
msgstr "Prikaži uvodni ekran"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check this check box to show a splashscreen before startup."
msgstr "Označite ovo polje za prikaz uvodnog ekrana prije pokretanja."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show drop target"
msgstr "Prikaži mijesto za spuštanje"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "Uncheck this if you do not want the &kget; Drop Target."
msgstr "Deselektujte ako ne želite &kget; Mjesto za spuštanje"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable animations"
msgstr "Omogući animacije"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enables few fancy animations."
msgstr "Omogući samo neke zanimljive animacije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Grupe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can group downloads."
msgstr "Možete grupno preuzimati."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kget; Groups</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kget; Groupe</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kget; Groups</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kget; Groupe</phrase>"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use default folders for groups as suggestion"
msgstr "Koristi podrazumijevani folder za grupe kao prijedlog"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tick this box if you want &kget; to use default folders for your downloads."
msgstr ""
"Označite ovaj kvadratić ako želite &kget; da koristi podrazumijevane foldere "
"za vaša preuzimanja."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Mreža"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can modify your network related settings here."
msgstr "Ovdije možete izmijeniti postavke mreže."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kget; Network</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kget; Mreža</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kget; Network</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kget; Mreža</phrase>"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "Limit Maximum Downloads Per Group"
msgstr "Maksimalan Limit Preuzimanja Po Grupi"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check this box if you want Download limits to be implemented."
msgstr "Označite kvadratić ako želite da implementirate  limit preuzimanja."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of downloads"
msgstr "Broj Preuzimanja"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can set the maximum simultaneous downloads using this box."
msgstr ""
"Možete postaviti maksimum istovremenih preuzimanja koristeći ovu opciju."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "Speed Limit"
msgstr "Brzina Preuzimanja"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check this box if you want the Global speed limits to be used."
msgstr "Označite ovdje ako želite koristiti Globalne limite brzine."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid "Global download limit"
msgstr "Globalni limit preuzimanja"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set the maximum global download limit."
msgstr "Postavi maksimalani globalni limit preuzimanja."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid "Global upload limit"
msgstr "Globalni limit dijeljenja"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set the maximum upload limit."
msgstr "Postavi globalni  limit dijeljenja."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reconnect on Error or Broken Connection"
msgstr "Ponovno konektuj u slučaju greške ili prekida veze"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want &kget; to reconnect after an error or a broken "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Označite ovdje ako želite &kget; da ponovno uspostavite konekciju u  slučaju "
"greške ili prekida veze."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of retries"
msgstr "Broj pokušaja"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set the maximum number of time &kget; will try to reconnect."
msgstr ""
"Postavite koliko će se maksimalno puta &kget; pokušati ponovno konektovati."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid "Retry after"
msgstr "Pokušaj poslije"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set the retrying interval here (in seconds)"
msgstr "Postavi interval ponovnog pokušaja ovdje (u sekundama)"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:425
#, no-c-format
msgid "Web Interface"
msgstr "Veb interfejs"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enable the web interface, check <guilabel>Enable Web Interface</"
"guilabel>; default port is 8080, and you configure any port higher than "
"1024. Then set <guilabel>User</guilabel> and <guilabel>Password</guilabel>. "
"You can access your web interface at http://127.0.0.1:&lt;port&gt;. You will "
"need to enter the username and password to get access."
msgstr ""
"Da omogućite veb interfejs,čekiraj <guilabel>Omogući Veb interfejs</"
"guilabel>; predoređeni port je 8080, i konfigurišite bilo koji port veci od "
"1025. Onda postavi  <guilabel>Korisnik</guilabel> i  <guilabel>Šifra</"
"guilabel>. Vašem veb interfejsu možete pristupiti na http://127.0.0.1:&lt;"
"port&gt;. Morate unijeti korsnicko ime i sifru da biste imali pristup."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kget; Web Interface</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kget; Veb Interfejs</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:440
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kget; Web Interface</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kget; Veb Interfejs</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "Potvrda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:449
#, no-c-format
msgid "Verify your downloads."
msgstr "Potvrdite vaša preuzimanja."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kget; Verification</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kget; Potvrda</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kget; Verification</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kget; Potvrda</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the two methods <guilabel>Checksums</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Signature</guilabel> you can verify your downloads. You just have "
"to tick the Automatic verification check box."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći dva metoda <guilabel>Prebroj bite </guilabel> i <guilabel>Potpis</"
"guilabel> možete potvrditi vaša preuzimanja. Samo morate označiti polje "
"automatske potvrde."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:467
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Dodatno"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modify Advanced Options."
msgstr "Izmijeni Dodatne opcije."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kget; Advanced Options</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kget; Dodatne Opcije</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kget; Advanced Options</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kget; Dodatne Opcije</phrase>"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disable confirmation dialogs (less verbosity)"
msgstr "Isključi dijaloge potvrda (manje opširno)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Disables the confirmation dialogs</action>, which causes verbosity."
msgstr "<action>Isključi dijaloge potvrda </action>, uzrokuje opširnost."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable system tray icon"
msgstr "Obavijest u sistemskom tray-u"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:503
#, no-c-format
msgid "This check box enables the &kget; system tray icon."
msgstr "Ovo polje omogućuje &kget; sistemsku trayy ikonu."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:511
#, no-c-format
msgid "Execute action after all downloads have been finished"
msgstr "Pokreni nakon što se sva preuzimanja završe"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this box to enable Quitting &kget; after all downloads have finished. "
"At startup you can choose to Restore Download state. Such as Stop All "
"downloads/ Start All downloads."
msgstr ""
"Označite polje da omogućite Prekide &kget; nakon završetka svih preuzimanja. "
"Pri pokretanju možete izabrati da Obnovite status preuzimanja. Kao što su "
"Prekini sva preuzimanja/ Pokreni sva preuzimanja."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:525
#, no-c-format
msgid "History backend"
msgstr "Backend Historije"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can choose your history backend as Sqlite or Xml."
msgstr "Možete izabrati Sqlite ili Xml kao backend vaše historije."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use as download manager for Konqueror"
msgstr "Koristi kao menadžer preuzimanja za  Konqueror:"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can set &kget; as your download manager for &konqueror;."
msgstr "Možete postaviti &kget; kao menadžer preuzimanja za &konqueror;."

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid "Monitor clipboard for files to download"
msgstr "Prati klipbord za fajlove za preuzimanje"

#. Tag: guimenuitem
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable &kde; global progress tracking"
msgstr "Omogući &konqueror;. praćenje napretka globalno"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set &kget; to show every single download or show overall progress."
msgstr ""
"Možete postaviti &kget; da prikazuje baš svako preuzimanje ili ukupan "
"napredak."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main Window"
msgstr "Glavni Prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:582
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overview of &kget;'s Main Window"
msgstr "Pregled  &kget;vog Glavnog Prozora"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:596
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>File</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr "<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> Meni"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:599
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Download...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Novo Preuzimanje...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:606
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add a new file to download"
msgstr "Dodaj novu datoteku za preuzimanje"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>I</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Import Transfers...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>I</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Uvezi Prenose...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid "Loads a *.kgt, *.metalink, *.meta4 or *.torrent file."
msgstr "Pokreće  *.kgt, *.metalink, *.meta4 ili *.torrent file."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:621
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export Transfers List...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>E</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Lista prenosta za izvoz</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid "Export the highlighted links to a .kgt file, to be loaded later."
msgstr "Izvezi označene linkove u .kgt Datoteku, da bi se poslije pokrenuli."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export Transfers as Plain "
"Text...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izvezi kao običan tekst</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:639
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exports the links being downloaded as plain text."
msgstr "Izvozi veze koje se preuzimaju kao obični tekst."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:643
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Import Links...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Uvozni linkovi</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:652
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Import Links</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Uvozni Linkovi</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:658
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Import Links</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Uvozni Linkovi</phrase>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:662
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This action brings up another window, where you can see and manipulate which "
"file to download. Also you can make a selection based on <guilabel>Videos</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Images</guilabel>, <guilabel>Audio</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Archives</guilabel>. There is also a text box to filter out "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Ova akcije aktivira drugi prozor, dje možete vidjeti i manipulisati "
"datotekama za preuzimanje. Također možete odabrati na osnovu  "
"<guilabel>Video</guilabel>, <guilabel>Slika</guilabel>, <guilabel>Audio</"
"guilabel> i  <guilabel>Arhive</guilabel>. Također postoji i polje teksta "
"koje filtrira rezultate."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Create a Metalink</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Kreiraj Metalink</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:673
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a metalink0"
msgstr "Kreiram metalink 0"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:679
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a Metalink0"
msgstr "Kreiram Metalink 0"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select between creating a new Metalink and loading an existing Metalink. "
"Click the <guilabel>Next</guilabel> button to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Želite li kreirati novi Metalink ili pokrenuti postojeći.Klinki na "
"<guilabel>Sledeći</guilabel>  za nastavak."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:686
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a metalink1"
msgstr "Kreiram Metalink 1"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:692
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a Metalink1"
msgstr "Kreiram Metalink 0"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:696
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose to enter some general optional information. Such as "
"where can this metalink be obtained from (Enter the &URL; in the text box "
"next to <guilabel>Origin</guilabel>)."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odabrati neke opšte informacije o opcijama. Kao što su gdje "
"pronaći ovaj metalink( Unesite &URL; u tekstualno polje do "
"<guilabel>Porijeklo</guilabel>)."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:699
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a metalink2"
msgstr "Kreiram Metalink 2"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a Metalink2"
msgstr "Kreiram Metalink 2"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:709
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you have to enter the &URL; from where you are trying to download the "
"file. Also you can enter some optional information such as Preference "
"(Priority) for a particular mirror if you are adding more then one mirrors, "
"for the file you want to download."
msgstr ""
"Ovdije unesite &URL; odakle pokušavate preuzeti datoteku. Također možete "
"unijeti dodatne informacije kao što su Preferiranje(Prioritet) za određeni "
"miror ako dodajete više od jednog mirora, za datoteku koju želite preuzeti."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:712
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a metalink 3"
msgstr "Kreiram Metalink 3"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:718
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a Metalink 3"
msgstr "Kreiram Metalink 3"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:722
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should be able to see a new window where all your files which will be "
"imported will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Trebali bi ste vidjeti novi prozor gdje će se sve vaše datoteke koje će biti "
"uvezene prikazati."

